abstract: "Pseudonymized numerical evidence for constrained multi-objective construction site layout planning, including run metrics, attained objective fronts, paired comparisons, fixed-set acoustic sensitivity results, and a separate illustrative case. Raw drawings and geometric optimization inputs are not included."
